Cell["\<\
Here we start with the population nearby to the refuge stable point, to which \
it quickly converges. Once the carrying capacity is increased past the cusp \
catastrophe point the population rises to the new single attracting point. \
Restoring the carrying capacity does not return the system to previous level, \
it now converges to the higher outbreak level.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.971787519282837*^9, 3.971787520227022*^9}, {
  3.971787812428432*^9, 3.971787855296637*^9}, {3.971787963287867*^9, 
  3.971788030148941*^9}, {3.97178808867564*^9, 
  3.9717881000441236`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"17102c14-511c-4eeb-bcbe-\
2b6dd812285b"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

